  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 3703.01 Requirements for Proper Care of Equine.\n\n(a) Regular foot care and maintenance shall be provided at least every 8 to 12 weeks.\n\n(b) Regular tooth care and maintenance shall be performed at the recommendation of your veterinarian.\n\nSource. #7989, eff 11-21-03, EXPIRED: 11-21-11\n\nNew. #10105, eff 4-4-12",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr3700.html"
